    {
      "id": "txt_srv_bench",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 928.9100411666668,
      "y": 1892.9293376666665,
      "width": 458,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_srv_bench"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 5209,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1764523975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793849529415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B. Benchmark Zero-Shot & Diagnóstico de Hardware\n• Testados em GGUF Q4_K_M: Llama 3.2 (1B/3B) e Qwen 2.5 (1.5B/3B)\n• Gargalo Memory-Bound (DDR3 ~13 GB/s):\n  - Modelos 3B (~2.7 GB RAM): caem p/ ~6.5 tokens/s\n  - Qwen 2.5 1.5B (~1.6 GB RAM): atinge 13.3 tokens/s!\n• Teto de 33.3% com Prompt Puro:\n  - Prompt grande (>300 tokens) gerava TTFT alto (1.5s–3.3s)\n  - Falsos positivos no Tool Calling (57.1% precisão;\n    Llama 1B buscava \"gasolina\" ao receber \"Bom dia\")",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B. Benchmark Zero-Shot & Diagnóstico de Hardware\n• Testados em GGUF Q4_K_M: Llama 3.2 (1B/3B) e Qwen 2.5 (1.5B/3B)\n• Gargalo Memory-Bound (DDR3 ~13 GB/s):\n  - Modelos 3B (~2.7 GB RAM): caem p/ ~6.5 tokens/s\n  - Qwen 2.5 1.5B (~1.6 GB RAM): atinge 13.3 tokens/s!\n• Teto de 33.3% com Prompt Puro:\n  - Prompt grande (>300 tokens) gerava TTFT alto (1.5s–3.3s)\n  - Falsos positivos no Tool Calling (57.1% precisão;\n    Llama 1B buscava \"gasolina\" ao receber \"Bom dia\")",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b05"
    },
